	(text "D2PAK tab = cathode on the quiet output node. Snubber 150R + 68p.\npolymer bulk: 80 mV pk-pk ripple at 600 V (calc), 0.60 A rms each. Output: Vout set point 22.770 V nominal, 22.40-23.15 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 82.36 0)
