	)
	(text "PG window: UV falling 20.61-21.39 V, OV rising 24.93-25.54 V.\nTPS3700 on a 3.3 V Zener rail; OUTA/OUTB low outside the window; SN74LVC1G17 (Ioff) drives the line:\nPG_HVAUX series resistor (high 2.51-2.77 V into the SYS 100k pull-down). Dead or unplugged -> unpowered buffer -> the SYS-IO-AUX 100k pull-down reads not-good."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 180.124 0)
		(effects
			(font
